          <h1 id="main">About The Louisian</h1>

          <h2 class="font-playfair text-[--gold-400] mt-8">Mission</h2>
          <p>
            The Louisian is the official student publication of Saint Louis University
            BEdS – Senior High Department. We are students writing for students,
            covering campus life, administration, arts, sports, and everything in
            between.
          </p>

          <h2 class="font-playfair text-[--gold-400] mt-8" id="standards">How we work</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-[--muted]">
            <li>
              Human-written articles only. No AI-generated text or AI-altered news
              images.
            </li>
            <li>
              Our photos are taken by Louisian photojournalists. Every image is
              credited.
            </li>
            <li>
              We correct major factual errors publicly, with a dated note.
            </li>
            <li>
              Identifiable photos of students require consent (see Photo Consent
              policy on Contact).
            </li>
            <li>
              Editorial decisions are made by the student board. The adviser reviews
              sensitive material for safety and legal risk, not to dictate position.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="font-playfair text-[--gold-400] mt-8">Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Official email: <a href="mailto:13007796@slu.edu.ph">13007796@slu.edu.ph</a>
          </p>
          <p>
            Send a tip, a letter to the editor, a correction/privacy request, or
            join the staff via the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page.
          </p>

